      "description": "The anti-buffering check, and the exit criterion of the sprint that built the shim. If response streaming were buffered \u2014 a missing FlushInterval: -1, or gzip on the upstream hop \u2014 the first token would arrive with the last and this ratio would sit at 1.0. Under real streaming load it must stay below 0.5.",
